      "snippet": "## Cam Bochman Onboarded - Dylan's brother Cameron (Cam) Bochman (+1-781-626-1562) added as trusted contact - Had earlier DM exchange where I stonewalled him (unknown contact protocol) — he was trying to get birthday gift ideas for Dylan - Upgraded to full trust with \"keep Dylan informed\" condition - **BB API lesson:** DM messages can have empty `chats[]` arrays. Always search by `handle.id` via `/api/v1/message/query`, not just chat lookup. Added to TOOLS.md. - Group chat with Cam exists from April 26 (date night planning thread)",
