      "snippet": "# 2026-03-28 (Saturday) ## Calendar Auth Failures in Morning Briefing - Today's 8:00 AM briefing: `gws calendar +agenda --days 7` returned 401 \"Calendar auth failed: Failed to get token\" - Gmail worked fine in the same session — separate OAuth tokens per service - Dylan says this is the **second day in a row** calendar auth failed at briefing time - Calendar worked fine when tested manually at 8:12 AM (transient/token refresh timing issue) - **Action:** If it fails again Monday, add retry logic to the morning briefing cron job",
